{"id":1212,"date":"2026-04-01T17:58:41","date_gmt":"2026-04-01T17:58:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aiadvancements.dilatevps1.cloudsites.net.au\/?page_id=1212"},"modified":"2026-08-10T16:51:52","modified_gmt":"2026-08-10T08:51:52","slug":"ai-chatbots","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/ai-development\/ai-chatbots\/","title":{"rendered":"AI Chatbots"},"content":{"rendered":"    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\n        <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\n\n    <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\n    <section \n        id=\"\" \n        data-name=\"acf_internal-hero\"\n        data-lazyload=\"1\" \n        class=\"relative \" \n        style=\"z-index: 0; background-color:#FFFFFF;\">\n        <div class=\"bg-color5 b1200:pt-200 b767:pt-180 pt-150\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"internal-hero-details max-w-[912px] mx-auto b1024:pb-24 b767:pb-20 pb-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t                    <div class=\"text-center flex items-center mb-[44px]\">\n                        <div class=\"h-[32px] w-[32px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <svg width=\"19\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\n                        <\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t        <h1 class=\" animate-watch standard__headline inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-color4 py-[11px] px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs super-title\">AI Chatbot Development for Perth Businesses<\/h1>\n                        <\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                    \n                    \n                        <!-- HEADLINE + SUMMARY -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 b1024:grid-cols-2 b1024:mt-16 b767:mt-10 mt-8 b767:gap-y-10 gap-y-8\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                                <div class=\"h-full\">\n                                            <h2 class=\"h1 animate-watch standard__headline block tracking-[-0.06em]\">AI Chatbots<\/h2>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                                <div class=\"button-wrap hidden b1024:inline-flex flex-col b600:flex-row gap-3 mt-[30px] b1024:items-end\">\n                                                <a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/contact\/\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 speak-btn flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                <span class=\"block circle relative\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"button-text z-10\">Speak to a human<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n                                                            <a href=\"\/#services\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-secondary-alt outline-color1 text-center overflow-hidden relative z-10\">\n                Explore our AI services            <\/a>\n                                            <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n\n                            <div class=\"b1024:pl-[61px] mb-10 b1024:mb-0\">\n                                <p>We design and build custom AI Chatbots that sit inside your business, handling internal requests, system queries, and operational workflows in a natural, reliable way, including customer-facing support where it makes sense.<\/p>\n<p>Through custom chatbot development that integrates directly with your website and core systems, we help organisations automate information flow and decision-making while maintaining full clarity, control, and data ownership.<\/p>\n                                <div class=\"button-wrap inline-flex b1024:hidden flex-col b767:flex-row gap-3 mt-[30px]\">\n                                                <a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/contact\/\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 speak-btn flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                <span class=\"block circle relative\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"button-text z-10\">Speak to a human<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n                                                            <a href=\"\/#services\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-secondary-alt outline-color1 text-center overflow-hidden relative z-10\">\n                Explore our AI services            <\/a>\n                                            <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                                    <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            \n                        <div class=\"internal-hero-video video-expand-wrapper\">\n\n                <div class=\"hero-video-wrapper relative\">\n\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <!-- MEDIA -->\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <div class=\"desktop-media\">\n\n                        \n                        \n                            <!-- DESKTOP VIDEO -->\n                                                        <div class=\"hero-oembed desktop-only w-full h-full\">\n                                <iframe \n                                    src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1192496208?autoplay=0&#038;muted=0&#038;background=0&#038;controls=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1&#038;sidedock=0\" \n                                    frameborder=\"0\" \n                                    allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" \n                                    allowfullscreen>\n                                <\/iframe>\n                            <\/div>\n\n                            <!-- MOBILE VIDEO -->\n                                                        <div class=\"hero-oembed mobile-only w-full h-full\">\n                                <iframe \n                                    src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1192496206?autoplay=0&#038;muted=0&#038;background=0&#038;controls=1&#038;title=0&#038;byline=0&#038;portrait=0&#038;dnt=1&#038;sidedock=0\" \n                                    frameborder=\"0\" \n                                    allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" \n                                    allowfullscreen>\n                                <\/iframe>\n                            <\/div>\n\n                        \n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <!-- THUMBNAIL -->\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                                            <div class=\"video-thumbnail absolute inset-0 z-20\">\n                            <picture class=\"w-full h-full\"><source media=\"(min-width: 481px)\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/image-8.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/image-8.jpg\" alt=\"AI Advancements team member inviting viewers to discuss AI chatbot solutions for their business\" style=\"object-fit:cover;object-position:center;\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1641\" height=\"920\" \/><\/picture>                        <\/div>\n                    \n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <!-- PLAY BUTTON -->\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                                            <button class=\"video-toggle absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-30\">\n                            <span class=\"play-btn flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <svg width=\"98\" height=\"98\" viewBox=\"0 0 98 98\" fill=\"none\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"49\" r=\"49\" fill=\"#FCFF6A\"\/>\n                                    <path d=\"M68 49L39.5 65.4545L39.5 32.5455L68 49Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/>\n                                <\/svg>\n                            <\/span>\n                        <\/button>\n                    \n                <\/div>\n\n            <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n    <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\n\n    \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n \r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n<section\r\n      id=\"\"\r\n      data-name=\"acf_approach-tab\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\"\r\n      class=\"relative \"\r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n    <div class=\"b1024:py-[124px] py-[80px] bg-color3 list-bg\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1130px] mx-auto\">\r\n                <div class=\"approach-title max-w-[664px] mx-auto b767:mb-[74px] mb-12 text-center two-column-content\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"heading-wrap flex-1\">\r\n                                    <h2 class=\"h2 animate-watch standard__headline block mb-10\">Chatbots designed to support internal <br>teams<\/h2>\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"summary-wrap ml-auto\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"approach-text\">\r\n                                <p>Our AI Chatbot services are designed to support both internal teams and external customers, integrating seamlessly with your systems or operating independently where needed.<\/p>\n<p>Internally, these chatbots act as task-focused assistants, helping staff find information, generate documents, trigger workflows, and complete routine actions across your systems.<\/p>\n<p>Externally, they have the capability to serve as customer support chatbots, providing reliable, on-brand customer interactions without removing human oversight.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/case-study\/curtin-hdr-ai-chatbot\/\">See how we built a multilingual AI chatbot for Curtin University<\/a> helped improve the student experience.<\/p>\n<p>Here\u2019s how we design AI Chatbots that automate real work inside your business, while still improving customer experience where it matters most:<\/p>\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"approach-content\">\r\n\r\n            <!-- TAB BUTTONS -->\r\n            <div class=\"tab-button-group flex justify-center gap-6 mb-11\">\r\n                                                                                                <button class=\"tab-button\" data-tab=\"0\">\r\n                                                    <\/button>\r\n                                                <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- TAB CONTENT -->\r\n            <div class=\"tab-contents\">\r\n\r\n                                                        \r\n                    <div class=\"tab-content-list transition-opacity duration-300\">\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            01                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Understand-queries-tasks-and-workflow-friction.jpg\" alt=\"Professional in dark AI Advancements shirt thoughtfully gesturing, representing the AI chatbot step to understand queries, tasks and workflow friction\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title b767:hidden mb-2 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                        Discovery                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Understand queries, tasks and workflow friction                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title hidden b767:block mb-7 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                Discovery                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Understand queries, tasks and workflow friction                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Understand-queries-tasks-and-workflow-friction.jpg\" alt=\"Professional in dark AI Advancements shirt thoughtfully gesturing, representing the AI chatbot step to understand queries, tasks and workflow friction\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>We start by identifying the questions people ask and the actions they are trying to complete. This includes analysing internal requests, repetitive tasks, system updates, and approval flows where staff currently rely on emails, forms, or manual handoffs.<\/p>\n<p>By understanding where teams lose time switching between systems or chasing information, we ensure the chatbot is designed to remove friction, not just answer questions.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            02                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Design-conversation-flows-that-complete-work.jpg\" alt=\"Two professionals in a collaborative discussion around a table, representing the AI chatbot step to design conversation flows that complete work\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title b767:hidden mb-2 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                        Design                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Design conversation flows that complete work                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title hidden b767:block mb-7 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                Design                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Design conversation flows that complete work                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Design-conversation-flows-that-complete-work.jpg\" alt=\"Two professionals in a collaborative discussion around a table, representing the AI chatbot step to design conversation flows that complete work\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>We design chatbot interactions around real business tasks, not scripted Q&amp;A. Conversation flows are built to reflect your workflows, rules, tone, and decision points, allowing the chatbot to guide users through actions such as generating documents, updating records, or triggering processes.<\/p>\n<p>Advanced AI models are used where appropriate, but always within clear guardrails so behaviour stays accurate, predictable, and aligned with how your teams already work.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            03                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Seamless-integration-with-your-website-and-systems.jpg\" alt=\"AI Advancements professional in dark shirt with arms crossed, representing the AI chatbot step of seamless integration with your website and systems\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title b767:hidden mb-2 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                        Integration                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Seamless integration with your website and systems                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title hidden b767:block mb-7 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                Integration                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Seamless integration with your website and systems                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Seamless-integration-with-your-website-and-systems.jpg\" alt=\"AI Advancements professional in dark shirt with arms crossed, representing the AI chatbot step of seamless integration with your website and systems\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>AI chatbots integrate directly with your internal systems so employees can access information quickly and take action without switching tools. Chatbots can connect to live systems such as CRMs, finance platforms, file stores, data warehouses, and operational systems, including production and asset data common in mining and property environments.<\/p>\n<p>Beyond retrieving information, chatbots can update records, submit forms, trigger workflows, and write data back into systems based on user input. This allows teams to get work done faster, using natural language instead of manual system navigation.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            04                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Automate-tasks-while-keeping-humans-in-control.jpg\" alt=\"Professional with glasses working at a laptop or standing desk, representing the AI chatbot step to automate tasks while keeping humans in control\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title b767:hidden mb-2 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                        Automation                                                     <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Automate tasks while keeping humans in control                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title hidden b767:block mb-7 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                Automation                                             <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Automate tasks while keeping humans in control                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Automate-tasks-while-keeping-humans-in-control.jpg\" alt=\"Professional with glasses working at a laptop or standing desk, representing the AI chatbot step to automate tasks while keeping humans in control\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>Chatbots automate appropriate tasks such as data lookups, report generation, system updates, and routine service requests. Where judgement, approval, or risk is involved, tasks are escalated to humans with full context already captured.<\/p>\n<p>This approach improves efficiency without removing accountability or trust.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            05                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refine-expand-and-scale-case-uses.jpg\" alt=\"AI chatbot consultant with glasses in dark shirt seated with hands clasped, representing the AI chatbot step to refine, expand and scale case uses\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title b767:hidden mb-2 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                        Refine                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Refine, expand, and scale case uses                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"super-title hidden b767:block mb-7 b767:text-xl text-base\">\r\n                                                Refine                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Refine, expand, and scale case uses                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refine-expand-and-scale-case-uses.jpg\" alt=\"AI chatbot consultant with glasses in dark shirt seated with hands clasped, representing the AI chatbot step to refine, expand and scale case uses\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>We continuously monitor chatbot accuracy, task success, and user behaviour, refining workflows over time. As confidence grows, chatbots can be extended to new systems, teams, and processes, scaling internal automation without increasing operational complexity.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                \r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- TAB BUTTONS -->\r\n            <div class=\"tab-button-group flex justify-center gap-6 mt-11\">\r\n                                                                                                <button class=\"tab-button\" data-tab=\"0\">\r\n                                                    <\/button>\r\n                                                <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n \r\n  \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n  <section \r\n      id=\"\" \r\n      data-name=\"acf_video-block\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\" \r\n      class=\"relative b1200:pb-[145px] b767:pb-100 pb-80 \" \r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n        <div class=\"container relative\">\r\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1130px] mx-auto\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"hero-video-wrapper relative\">\r\n                        <video class=\"hero-video w-full\" loop playsinline>\r\n                            <source src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/video-3.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\">\r\n                        <\/video>\r\n\r\n                        <button class=\"video-toggle absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                            <span class=\"play-btn flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                                <svg width=\"98\" height=\"98\" viewBox=\"0 0 98 98\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"49\" r=\"49\" fill=\"#FCFF6A\"\/><path d=\"M68 49L39.5 65.4545L39.5 32.5455L68 49Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                            <\/span>\r\n                        <\/button>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n\r\n  \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n  <section \r\n      id=\"\" \r\n      data-name=\"acf_about-our-service\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\" \r\n      class=\"relative \" \r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n      <div class=\"our-values-area py-80 b767:py-100 bg-color1\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 b767:grid-cols-2 b1024:grid-cols-3 b1200:grid-cols-4 gap-y-10 gap-x-6\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"border-b border-color4 pb-40 text-color4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"h-[59px] w-[59px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                                <svg width=\"33\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                                            <h3 class=\"my-5\">\r\n                                    Faster access to the right information                                <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"\">\r\n                                    <p>AI chatbots give staff and customers instant access to accurate, up-to-date information from across your systems. Instead of searching through files, emails, or multiple platforms, users can ask a question and get a clear, reliable answer in seconds.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"border-b border-color4 pb-40 text-color4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"h-[59px] w-[59px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                                <svg width=\"33\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                                            <h3 class=\"my-5\">\r\n                                    Less time spent searching, more time doing                                <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"\">\r\n                                    <p>By centralising knowledge and automating routine lookups, chatbots reduce the time teams spend hunting for information or chasing updates. This helps employees stay informed about what\u2019s happening in the business and focus on higher-value work.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"border-b border-color4 pb-40 text-color4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"h-[59px] w-[59px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                                <svg width=\"33\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                                            <h3 class=\"my-5\">\r\n                                    Automated tasks, not just answers                                <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"\">\r\n                                    <p>Beyond answering questions, chatbots can complete routine tasks such as updating records, generating documents, submitting requests, or triggering workflows. This removes repetitive manual effort and keeps everyday processes moving without friction.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"border-b border-color4 pb-40 text-color4\">\r\n                            <div class=\"h-[59px] w-[59px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                                <svg width=\"33\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                                            <h3 class=\"my-5\">\r\n                                    Consistent, reliable information across the business                                 <\/h3>\r\n                                                                                        <div class=\"\">\r\n                                    <p>By standardising how information is accessed and actions are taken, chatbots reduce errors and variation between people and teams. Everyone works from the same source of truth, improving accuracy, confidence, and operational consistency.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\r\n                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n  <\/section>\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n\r\n  \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n  <section \r\n      id=\"\" \r\n      data-name=\"acf_logo-slider\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\" \r\n      class=\"relative \" \r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n        <div class=\"logo-slider-area pt-[145px]\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <div class=\"logo-slider-title text-center flex items-center justify-center mb-16 b767:mb-[72px]\">\r\n                    <div class=\"ls-title-icon h-[48px] w-[48px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\r\n                        <svg width=\"30\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"ls-title bg-color1 text-color4 px-6 h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs b767:text-[18px] font-semibold\">Trusted by leading Australian organisations<\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n                        <div cla